\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces SoftWall\xspace  architecture for one release period. Steps: NeuralRx\xspace  outcome ({\fontfamily  {pzd}\fontencoding  {U}\fontseries  {m}\fontshape  {n}\selectfont  \char 182}), outcome batch ({\fontfamily  {pzd}\fontencoding  {U}\fontseries  {m}\fontshape  {n}\selectfont  \char 183}), recovery retiming ({\fontfamily  {pzd}\fontencoding  {U}\fontseries  {m}\fontshape  {n}\selectfont  \char 184}), independent verification ({\fontfamily  {pzd}\fontencoding  {U}\fontseries  {m}\fontshape  {n}\selectfont  \char 185}), dispatch ({\fontfamily  {pzd}\fontencoding  {U}\fontseries  {m}\fontshape  {n}\selectfont  \char 186}), AI lease ({\fontfamily  {pzd}\fontencoding  {U}\fontseries  {m}\fontshape  {n}\selectfont  \char 187}), and completion marker ({\fontfamily  {pzd}\fontencoding  {U}\fontseries  {m}\fontshape  {n}\selectfont  \char 188}). The steps are drawn for the evaluated multi-GPU placement (b); the single-GPU placement (a) exchanges IQ, LLR, and TB buffers through CUDA IPC rings and uses the same steps. In (b), cuPHY instance 0 owns TB1-TB3, instance 1 owns TB4 and TB5, and ellipses mark further TBs.}}{7}{figure.caption.8}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:overall}{{5}{7}{\sys architecture for one release period. Steps: \NRx outcome (\ding {182}), outcome batch (\ding {183}), recovery retiming (\ding {184}), independent verification (\ding {185}), dispatch (\ding {186}), AI lease (\ding {187}), and completion marker (\ding {188}). The steps are drawn for the evaluated multi-GPU placement (b); the single-GPU placement (a) exchanges IQ, LLR, and TB buffers through CUDA IPC rings and uses the same steps. In (b), cuPHY instance 0 owns TB1-TB3, instance 1 owns TB4 and TB5, and ellipses mark further TBs}{figure.caption.8}{}}
